# Price reduction

You can now lower the total price of a membership, with a feature for creating price reductions.

Turn it on in [settings](/settings#price_reductions). A reduction is either a percentage or a fixed amount, with an optional overall cap. You then create reductions, and the cards some of them can require, from the Other (…) menu.

Members can choose one on the registration form, or when renewing their membership, and enter the requested details if a card is required. The amount then appears on the membership and on the invoice, on its own line.

A reduction can require a card, or be available only for some depots.

The details are in [the handbook](/handbook/price_reductions). [Write to me](/support_tickets/new) if a question remains, or if something is missing.
